# Settings for a Dovecote relay (see README, "Settings"). Install as
# /etc/dovecote/dovecote.env. Pass it to both the server and the admin command
# with --env-file, so both follow the same rules. Lines are DOVECOTE_NAME=value.
#DOVECOTE_NAME=Dovecote
#DOVECOTE_WEB_FONTS=0
#DOVECOTE_INACTIVE_DAYS=90
